integ5 0079 = patches/exl3p/0068-exl3p-contract-records.patch (overnight 2026-10-31), renumbered for the integrated stack on 3f94715d.

exl3p 0068: contract: nvcc 13.3's records for the four EXL3 prompt kernels after 0067

Registers as nvcc 13.3 compiles the five-SM fatbin (sm_80/86/89/120/121, the engine's flags), static shared bytes
unchanged: tf_exl3_prompt_gu, tf_exl3_prompt_down (a 13.3 entry; its 13.2 record stays), tf_exl3_prompt_gu_k6 and
tf_exl3_prompt_down_k6 (pending_133). Derived with opt/overnight/exl3p/tools/usage.sh, which reproduces 3f94715d's
records from 3f94715d's kernels.

